      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 2v, left side (first section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>[... &ldquo;Why is your name] call[ed Todah?&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>He said to him: &ldquo;About me] David said, &ldquo;A psalm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>for todah&rsquo;.&rdquo; He said to him: &ldquo;Fool! about you</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>David said, &lsquo;He who sacrifices todah honors me&rsquo;.&rdquo; And he decreed upon him,</p>\n</li>\n<li>and they executed him. Aglitus the governor answered</li>\n<li>\n<p>and said to Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Pera[h\u0323ia]h : &ldquo;The five</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>disciples of Yeshu were exe[cuted]; Yeshu</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the wicked and Yoh\u0323anan, who mi[sl]ed the people&mdash;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>what execution do they deserve?&rdquo; They answered and said [ ... ...&nbsp; ]&nbsp;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
