      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 2v, right side (fourth section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>[ ... ... ] in the water- holes (?) [ ... ... ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[The day] on which Yeshu [was crucified]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>was the fourteenth of Nisan, and when [they returned]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>(and) brought him&nbsp;out of the tomb (?) (in) which&nbsp;he was buried and dragged him</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>through the streets of Tiberias, (it was) day twenty-first</p>\n</li>\n<li>of Nisan. He who brought a judgment upon Yeshu the wicked and upon his disciples&mdash;</li>\n<li>\n<p>He will bring a judgment and retribution on whoever abandons the worship of Heaven and worships and bows down to Yeshu</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the wicked and (on) whoever says, &ldquo;He ascended to Heaven and is missing (?) ...&rdquo;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
